---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller != projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_supplied: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_state: tokens already supplied
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert CannotCancelAfterTokenSupply
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_withdrawn: tokens not supplied
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_require_return: capital was previously withdrawn
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_set_canceled: capital not withdrawn
    q_require_return --> q_return: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalCapitalRaised + fees)
    q_return --> q_set_canceled: capital returned successfully
    q_set_canceled --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled

    note right of q_check_withdrawn
        INV-001: if capital withdrawn, must be returned for investor refunds
        INV-002: cancellation blocked after token supply
    end note
